WEBVTT

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/1-0
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Analyst>Thanks for joining, let us walk through how an order gets entered.</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/2-0
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v SME>We enter every order on the day it arrives by email.</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/3-0
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
<v SME>Orders from the web portal are out of scope, another team handles those.</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/4-0
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
<v SME>Now I search for the customer account.</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/5-0
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.000
<v SME>The order number goes into the reference field before I save.</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/6-0
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:55.000
<v Analyst>What happens when the order total is very large?</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/7-0
00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:04.000
<v SME>Anything over ten thousand needs a manager to approve it first.</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/8-0
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.000
<v SME>I check the plant code in my notes file.</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/9-0
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:56.000
<v Analyst>That covers the normal case, thank you.</v>

3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-00000000e2e0/10-0
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:25.000
<v SME>Send me the document when it is ready.</v>
